 variables are introduced into the model, and is not significant in the multiple regression analysis. On the other hand, the categorized age behaves as a confounding variable on the relationship that the variable \"having dependents\"", "bbox": {"x": 839.8, "y": 1554.3, "width": 699.0, "height": 509.29999999999995}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "www.scielo.br/reeusp", "bbox": {"x": 1339.6, "y": 2106.7, "width": 196.0999999999999, "height": 24.800000000000182}}], "ms": 350.56}